cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Biogas Carbon Offsetting: Uncertainty and Overcrediting Analysis"
abstract: >-
  Data and code accompanying the ETH Zurich master's thesis "Determining Uncertainties and
  Overcrediting in Biogas-based Carbon Offsetting Projects". The repository contains a manually
  transcribed dataset of emission reduction parameters for 13 household biogas projects registered
  under the CDM and the Gold Standard (AMS-I.E, AMS-III.R, GS TPDDTEC), literature reviews on fNRB
  and digester functionality, and Monte Carlo notebooks that estimate overcrediting.
